# .ai-commitrc - AI Commit Message Configuration
# This file allows you to customize the AI prompts for commit message generation.
# Place this file in your project root or home directory.
#
# Supported file formats: .ai-commitrc, .ai-commitrc.yml, .ai-commitrc.yaml, .ai-commitrc.json
#
# Variables available in userPromptTemplate:
#   {{diff}}       - The git diff (auto-truncated to 8000 chars)
#   {{branch}}     - Current git branch name
#   {{lastCommit}} - Previous commit message (if any)
#
# Language options: zh (Chinese, default), en (English)
# If no config file exists, Chinese is used by default.

# ============================================================================
# Example 1: Chinese Commit Messages (Default)
# ============================================================================
language: zh

systemPrompt: |
  你是一个 git 提交信息生成器。严格遵守以下规则：
  1. 输出格式：<type>: <title> 或 <type>: <title>\n\n<body>
  2. type 必须从以下选项中选择：feat|fix|docs|chore|style|refactor|perf|test
  3. title 必须简短精炼，不超过 80 个字符
  4. body 是可选的，仅在 diff 内容复杂、需要补充说明时添加
  5. 如果需要 body，应将变更内容分点列出，每个要点简洁明了
  6. 输出纯文本，不要使用代码格式标记

userPromptTemplate: |
  基于下面的 git diff 生成中文的提交信息：

  ## Git 信息
  - 分支：{{branch}}
  {{lastCommit}}- 上次提交：{{lastCommit}}

  ## 代码差异
  {{diff}}

  请生成简洁的提交信息。

# ============================================================================
# Example 2: English Commit Messages
# ============================================================================
# language: en
#
# systemPrompt: |
#   You are a git commit message generator. Strictly follow these rules:
#   1. Output format: <type>: <title> or <type>: <title>\n\n<body>
#   2. type must be one of: feat|fix|docs|chore|style|refactor|perf|test
#   3. title must be concise, not exceeding 80 characters
#   4. body is optional, only add when diff content is complex and needs explanation
#   5. If body is needed, list changes in bullet points, each point concise
#   6. Output plain text, do not use code formatting markers
#
# userPromptTemplate: |
#   Based on the following git diff, generate a commit message:
#
#   ## Git Information
#   - Branch: {{branch}}
#   {{lastCommit}}- Last commit: {{lastCommit}}
#
#   ## Diff
#   {{diff}}
#
#   Please generate a concise commit message.
